  "visualBrief": "Signed PMTiles arc across the Euphrates, ten central ogee spillway chutes and crest machinery. The mapped lower powerhouse, stepped concrete terraces, and crest machinery complete the visible complex.",
  "heightPolicy": "The signed native reservoir edge and photo match establish the arch and downstream facing. A standard terrain sample at local [0, −360] provides one 681 m datum. The crest is 16 m above that datum, and the downstream reach is modeled 120 m below it. Surveyed operational elevations, chute thickness and exact rock contacts are approximate.",
