      "observed": "Pale upstream-convex concrete arch with a central array of narrow ogee spillway chutes, regular piers and teal gate mechanisms. Smooth flanking wall panels tie into steep rock abutments. Yellow machinery sits at the southeast crest edge with a downstream power-yard deck."
